"Replace ``sensor.set_vsync_output(pin)`` with "
"``sensor.set_vsync_callback(callback)`` and toggle the ``Pin`` from inside "
"the callback (:ref:`the VSYNC change <v3_9_4_vsync>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ersetze ``sensor.set_vsync_output(pin)`` durch "
"``sensor.set_vsync_callback(callback)`` und schalte den ``Pin`` innerhalb "
"des Callbacks um (:ref:`die VSYNC-Änderung <v3_9_4_vsync>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.4.rst:148
msgid ""
"Re-tune any MT9V034 gain/exposure workarounds against the corrected math "
"(:ref:`the MT9V034 change <v3_9_4_mt9v034>`)."
msgstr ""
"Stimme alle MT9V034-Verstärkungs-/Belichtungs-Workarounds gegen die "
"korrigierte Berechnung neu ab (:ref:`die MT9V034-Änderung "
